#: ../../source/reference/generated/utils/pams.utils.autocorrelation.rst:7
msgid "autocorrelation"
msgstr "autocorrelation"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.autocorrelation:1
msgid "Compute the sample autocorrelation of a series at a lag."
msgstr "系列の、あるラグにおける標本自己相関を計算します。"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.autocorrelation:3
msgid ""
"The estimator is the one used for correlograms, :math:`\\sum_{t=1}^{n-k} "
"(x_t - \\bar{x})(x_{t+k} - \\bar{x}) / \\sum_{t=1}^{n} (x_t - "
"\\bar{x})^2`, where :math:`n` is the length of the series and :math:`k` "
"is the lag."
msgstr ""
"推定量はコレログラムで用いられるもの :math:`\\sum_{t=1}^{n-k} (x_t - \\bar{x})(x_{t+k} - "
"\\bar{x}) / \\sum_{t=1}^{n} (x_t - \\bar{x})^2` です。ここで :math:`n` "
"は系列の長さ、:math:`k` はラグです。"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.autocorrelation
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.autocorrelation:9
msgid "series, e.g. log returns or absolute log returns."
msgstr "系列。例えば対数リターンや対数リターンの絶対値。"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.autocorrelation:13
msgid ""
"lag :math:`k`. It must be positive and smaller than the length of "
"``values``."
msgstr "ラグ :math:`k`。正の値で、``values`` の長さより小さい必要があります。"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.autocorrelation
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.autocorrelation:17
msgid "autocorrelation at ``lag``."
msgstr "``lag`` における自己相関。"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.autocorrelation
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.autocorrelation:21
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "例"

